msgstr "![Batch image](./BatchImage.png){ id=img_BatchImage }"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../../info/wxmaxima.md:295
msgid ""
"Attention: Although the file `Quadratic.mac` has a usual _Maxima_ extension "
